Z||000000||olympic||08-02-2000||11:48 PM|||| <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sho1.jpg"> <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sho2.jpg"> <P>  Pretty cool huh?   Wouldn't this kind of setup work on a fiero without the loss of the a/c compressor?<P>   Also, while I was surfin around <A HREF="http://www.shotimes.com" TARGET=_blank>www.shotimes.com</A>  I learned that the SHO engine and tranny are mounted to a removable cradle just like the Fiero.  Also, there is a limited slip differential available for the SHO 5 speed.  It's no wonder that some Fiero owners have put this engine in their car.  It would make a great auto cross unit or even a daily driver.<P>P.S-  Does anyone else think that the SHO intake is cool beyond words???||||reg||3
