Z||000005||olympic||08-03-2000||04:24 PM||||   The kit pictured above is from <A HREF="http://www.shoshop.com" TARGET=_blank>www.shoshop.com</A>  and is very expensive ($4000 USD +).  Its available in 6,9,12 psi kits.  The blower unit itself is a vortech so maybe more info is available on their site.<P>   The blower, shaft, brackets and hoses would be easily adapted to a Fiero.  But you would be on your own geting the correct injectors, chip and other stuff.||||reg||1
